### Create station
POST http://localhost:4004/api/stations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Station C",
  "cityId": 1
}

### List all stations
GET http://localhost:4004/api/stations

### Get stations by city
GET http://localhost:4004/api/stations/city/1

### Update station
PUT http://localhost:4004/api/stations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nom": "Station A (updated)",
  "cityId": 1
}
